# Byte-exact files: never convert line endings.
# tests/fixtures/statistics/* are golden files that the C# and Swift implementations must both
# reproduce byte for byte (LF, no BOM); the other fixtures are recorded evidence replayed verbatim.
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true on Windows rewrites them to CRLF on checkout and the contract
# tests fail on every fresh Windows clone.
tests/fixtures/** -text
